# Skills are authored in rocket-agents, nowhere else

Author a skill only at `~/p/agents/src/skills/core/<name>/SKILL.md`, register it in `src/skills/skill-rules.map.json`, then run `skills:compile` and `skills:link`. `~/.claude/skills/`, `~/.agents/` and the library checkout are generated output that the link wipes, whatever the superpowers `writing-skills` skill says.
